## 2026 Board Election Results  
The Clojurists Together board is happy to announce the results of our [elections](https://www.clojuriststogether.org/news/2026-nominations-and-your-vote/). We have two new board members and one returning board member filling our three open 2-year slots (Nov. 2026 through Oct. 2028).  

-Lorelai Lyons (returning)  
-xx
-xx

Thanks to everyone who stood for election. Board members continuing for the remainder of their 2-year term are  Daniel Compton, Heather Moore-Farley, Christoph Neumann, and Daniel Slutsky.  

A HUGE SHOUT-OUT AND THANKS to the outgoing board members lvh and Maria Geller for their years of service to the board and the Clojure community.  
 

## Annual Meeting: 17th November (10 am PT)  
Members, please join us on November 17th (10 am Pacific Time) for our 2026 Annual Board Meeting. You'll find the call in information for Zoom in your email. For anyone that has been thinking about becoming a member ([developers](https://www.clojuriststogether.org/developers/) or [company](https://www.clojuriststogether.org/companies/)), **now is your time!!**   

Please contact me if you have any questions at kdavis@clojuriststogether.org  

